      "content": "thanks for that. could we make it a bit more intense though? i want to make sure they know we aren't just asking for \"input,\" we're saying they are actually overstepping. can you add some arguments about how it's a violation of our fundamental rights to try and take control of these topics away from parents? i want to frame it as the school overstepping its bounds and interfering with the family unit.",
